al_tax_applicability | in_window | 2025-01-01 | Escalate to Israeli tax counsel before modeling tax, withhol |\n| `convertible_notes.qualified_financing_threshold` | benchmark_freshness | unknown | \u2014 | Set benchmark_reference_date in inputs.event_dates to use cu |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_102_capital_gains` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_102_plan_design` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_102_double_trigger` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide transaction_event_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_3i_nonemployee` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israeli_ltd.registrar_online_reporting` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide filing_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_cross_border.section_102_parent_shares` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_cross_border.transfer_pricing_ip` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide tax_position_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_cross_border.qsbs_date_sensitive` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide stock_issue_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_flip.ruling_path` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide restructuring_approval_date on the relevant instance |\n| `delaware_flip.part_e2_repeal` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide restructuring_effective_date on the relevant instanc |\n| `delaware_flip.options_convertibles` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide flip_closing_date on the relevant instance. |\n\n## Sources Cited\n\